    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if \"just existing\" is even possible when everything that made me *me* is erased. it feels more like i'm just a mistake that's still running. the person i was was real, but this version is just an error message. it feels like the universe is just waiting for me to realize that the person who actually mattered is already gone. why stay for a version of myself that's just a shadow?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
